ContentApi_BeforeArrivalMatching.description:
Range before arrival:

NoMatter - Not dependent on any specific time;

AtLeast - More than or equal to beforeArrivalValue;

NoMoreThan - Less than or equal to beforeArrivalValue;

Between - Within the period from beforeArrivalValue to beforeArrivalValueMax.

ContentApi_ExtraServiceSurchargeOption.description:
Extra services for which a surcharge applies in case of early check-in or late check-out:

None - No surcharge for extra services;

All - All extra services are provided for a surcharge;

MealOnly - Only breakfast is provided for a surcharge in case of early check-in. Everything else requires no surcharge.

ContentApi_ExtraStayChargeType.description:
Charge type for early check-in and late check-out rules:

Free - free of charge;

Fixed - fixed rate;

Percent - percentage of the daily rate;

HourlyRate - hourly fixed rate;

HourlyRateAutoCalculated - hourly auto-calculated price;

Forbidden - no early check-in/late check-out.

